# Test certificate authority: certificate and private key. Only the test APK holds the key, which
# LocalAnthropic signs a fresh api.anthropic.com leaf with. The certificate alone ships in the app
# APK as app/src/debug/res/raw/test_ca.pem, which is what makes the app trust those leaves.
#
# Debug builds only: app/src/debug/res/xml/network_security_config.xml is the sole trust anchor
# that references it, and the platform ignores that file for a non-debuggable APK. Not a secret,
# and never used against a real server.
